<title>CANADA: Air Canada Q3 shr net slips.</title>
<headline>Air Canada Q3 shr net slips.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.79		   C$0.89</p>
<p> Net			149,000		  182,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,391,000		1,315,000</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.91		   C$0.47</p>
<p> Net			167,000		   74,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,675,000		3,421,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Third-quarter earnings for 1995 included a one-time C$58 million gain on the sale of Continental Airlines share warrants.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
